id: pm-jira-release-caller-pilot
title: Pilot the pinned reusable Daily Release workflow
description: "Pilot for unbraind/pm-ops#272. Replace copied release orchestration with the verified v2026.11.14 reusable workflow, retain explicit empty changelog sections and package release guards, and keep activation gated on the first cross-repository npm OIDC preflight. No merge, dispatch or publication is authorized."
